# Outfit head (R18): a noir fedora: a low pinched crown, a wide brim all round that curls up at the back and sides
# and snaps down at the front, accent band.
# Head frame: the head fills x 3..8, y 3..7, z 0..5 (pivot 5 5 0).
name outfit_fedora
grid 5
size 12 12 7
slot felt SwatchMain
slot band SwatchAccent
cyl 5.5 6 4 5 5.4 felt
cyl 5.5 6 5 6 5.4 felt
carve cyl 5.5 6 5 6 4.4
carve box 7 0 5 12 12 6
box 9 3 3 12 9 4 felt
carve box 9 3 4 12 9 5
carve box 3 4 4 8 8 5
cyl 5.5 6 5 7 2.9 felt
carve box 4 5.5 6 8 6.5 7
carve box 7 4 6 9 5 7
carve box 7 7 6 9 8 7
paint cyl 5.5 6 5 6 2.9 band
pivot 5 6 0
